{"author":{"id":"53b38b4189542570b1a723cdea9ea54af99104fbc59b44537f04a0e63f4629c5"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795290098,"nonce":"BL6QU+3uF0tGlx0ugoBJNdk230E=","title":"L4 — Libadwaita restyle of landing page, header, footer","message":"## Context\nLanding uses generic Tailwind cards and Catppuccin purple. Rework into libadwaita patterns on L3's tokens.\n\n## Files\n- `src/components/Header.astro:1` — AdwHeaderBar look: headerbar bg/border tokens, flat title, suggested-action pill for \"Get Started\" (`:24`)\n- `src/components/Hero.astro:20` — \"Download Now\" is a `\u003cbutton\u003e` with no action: make it an `\u003ca\u003e` pill to https://github.com/ARKye03/morghulis/releases\n- `src/components/BentoGrid.astro` — `.card` look (card bg, 12px radius, card-shade, no heavy shadows), icon tiles use accent\n- `src/components/Footer.astro:7` — fg/dim-label tokens, current year from `new Date().getFullYear()`\n- `src/pages/index.astro:59` — `#logo-mask` uses `var(--color-primary-dark)`; switch to window-bg token so the scroll intro matches both themes; keep GSAP timeline behavior\n\n## Approach\n- Libadwaita refs: header bar, boxed list, card, pill / suggested-action button, dim-label\n- Replace `dark:` color pairs with L3 semantic utilities\n- Keep layout, copy and GSAP scroll animation\n\n## Depends on\nL3 — theme tokens and toggle\n\n## Out of scope\n- Installation, configuration, 404 pages (L5)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Landing page in both themes uses only L3 tokens (no remaining `primary-light`/`primary-dark`/`background-*` classes in these files)\n- \"Download Now\" navigates to the releases page\n- Scroll intro animation still runs and ends on a readable page in both themes\n- `pnpm check`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm fmt:check`, `pnpm build` pass","files":null}]}